      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 29,
      "title": {
        "en": "Warm and knowledgeable veterinary practice team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the receptionists, technicians, and veterinary surgeons for their courteous, friendly, and attentive approach. Longtime clients highlight that staff answer medical questions thoroughly and listen carefully to concerns. While one reviewer noted an uncomfortably drawn-out pricing discussion, the vast majority praise the team's reliable communication and clinical guidance."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 25,
      "title": {
        "en": "Tender handling for companion animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how gently dogs and cats are treated during examinations, diagnostic testing, and routine vaccinations. Clients with sensitive or nervous pets appreciate the soothing manner displayed by clinical assistants and doctors throughout procedures. Families express reassurance seeing their pets greeted warmly by name upon entering the clinic."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective treatments and preventative medical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report dependable outcomes across a wide spectrum of veterinary treatments, ranging from dental procedures and skin allergy therapies to routine annual check-ups. Pet parents note that accurate diagnoses and clear home-care advice help animals recover quickly from unexpected ailments. Reviewers express strong trust in the hospital's clinical standards."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
